// Regression guard for the string-literal pool.
//
// ~300 distinct literals exercise string_literal_pool emission
// (emit_string_literal_values_rodata_acc + the rodata section), the path where the
// compiler faulted while compiling data_structures/string_escapes.silica -- an
// atom-table pointer reaching string-scanning code. That file has 305 literals in
// case arms; this mirrors its shape at trial scale so a regression fails here in
// seconds instead of hanging a self-host build.
//
// lookup("k299") = 299; 299 - 257 = 42.

